      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SPOOK CROCKER (4) resumes from a spell of six months after showing some very good form last campaign, closing it off with a win over 2190m at this circuit. Unbeaten in six outings at this venue. Expecting a bright start to the campaign. YANKEE MOJOH (1) came from wider and dug deep to score last start at Melton, getting home by just a nose. That was his second success from his last three outings in Victoria. Hasn't missed a place in six tries at this circuit and distance, winning three, and should get every chance from the ace draw. COLOSSAL HOPE (5) is nicely placed returning to SA having won both times he has raced here. BUBBA SCRUB NZ (6) returns to the front row and owns a decent record at this distance.",
